ory\">As of Oct 12, July to August came in under 90% of normal in 39 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Benewah County. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 32% of normal in May to June and 13% in June to July. So far in 2026, May to June stands at 48%. Grid 32755 had its driest year in 1952, at 59% of normal.</p>"}
